<div class="title">
CYBERCROWD R2 BUCKET CREATION PROMPTS
</div>

<div class="sub">
Canonical bucket deployment prompts for Cloudflare R2 operational survivability.
Use these prompts when creating live infrastructure buckets.
</div>


<div class="promptCard">

<div class="promptId">
CC-R2-PROMPT-001
</div>

<div class="promptTitle">
Ledger Events Bucket
</div>

<div class="promptBlock">
Create Cloudflare R2 bucket:

Bucket Name:
cybercrowd-ledger-events

Bucket Purpose:
Append-only ledger event authority.

Bucket Visibility:
Private

Lifecycle:
Persistent

Retention:
Long-term

Encryption:
Enabled

Primary Role:
Store canonical ledger event chains,
device events,
replay references,
governance receipts,
and operational continuity records.

Failure Policy:
Never auto-delete.

Replay Support:
Enabled.

Audit Survivability:
Maximum.
</div>

</div>



<div class="promptCard">

<div class="promptId">
CC-R2-PROMPT-002
</div>

<div class="promptTitle">
Deadletter Bucket
</div>

<div class="promptBlock">
Create Cloudflare R2 bucket:

Bucket Name:
cybercrowd-deadletter

Bucket Purpose:
Malformed payload isolation and failed event quarantine.

Bucket Visibility:
Private

Lifecycle:
Short-to-medium retention

Retention:
30-90 days

Encryption:
Enabled

Primary Role:
Store rejected payloads,
routing failures,
event corruption,
and replay anomalies.

Failure Policy:
Allow expiration after retention window.

Replay Support:
Optional.

Audit Survivability:
Medium.
</div>

</div>



<div class="promptCard">

<div class="promptId">
CC-R2-PROMPT-003
</div>

<div class="promptTitle">
Replay Bucket
</div>

<div class="promptBlock">
Create Cloudflare R2 bucket:

Bucket Name:
cybercrowd-replay

Bucket Purpose:
Replay engine and operational simulation storage.

Bucket Visibility:
Private

Lifecycle:
Persistent

Retention:
Long-term

Encryption:
Enabled

Primary Role:
Store replayable event chains,
simulation frames,
device mesh playback,
and operational reconstruction states.

Failure Policy:
Never auto-delete.

Replay Support:
Core system dependency.

Audit Survivability:
High.
</div>

</div>



<div class="promptCard">

<div class="promptId">
CC-R2-PROMPT-004
</div>

<div class="promptTitle">
Surface Cache Bucket
</div>

<div class="promptBlock">
Create Cloudflare R2 bucket:

Bucket Name:
cybercrowd-surface-cache

Bucket Purpose:
Public accelerated edge delivery cache.

Bucket Visibility:
Public-read

Lifecycle:
Replaceable cache layer

Retention:
Short-term

Encryption:
Optional

Primary Role:
Serve graphics,
media previews,
surface assets,
and cached public delivery objects.

Failure Policy:
Cache rebuild allowed.

Replay Support:
Disabled.

Audit Survivability:
Low.
</div>

</div>



<div class="promptCard">

<div class="promptId">
CC-R2-PROMPT-005
</div>

<div class="promptTitle">
Archive Bucket
</div>

<div class="promptBlock">
Create Cloudflare R2 bucket:

Bucket Name:
cybercrowd-archive

Bucket Purpose:
Immutable historical continuity archive.

Bucket Visibility:
Private

Lifecycle:
Permanent

Retention:
Never expire

Encryption:
Enabled

Primary Role:
Store canonical media,
historical snapshots,
lineage records,
continuity captures,
and preservation artifacts.

Failure Policy:
Never auto-delete.

Replay Support:
Enabled.

Audit Survivability:
Maximum.
</div>

</div>


